  description: "You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by Tributing 1
    Normal Summoned monster. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Gizmek
    Yata, the Gleaming Vanguard\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF During your Main Phase,
    if this card was Normal or Special Summoned this turn, you can: Immediately after
    this effect resolves, Normal Summon 1 monster. If you do, you cannot Special
    Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except monsters with the same original
    Type as that monster.\r\n\u25CF If this card Special Summoned by its own effect
    is Tributed: Gain 2050 LP."
